---
import Markdown from "@moesegfault/style/astro/Markdown.astro";
import Formula from "@moesegfault/style/astro/Math.astro";

/** 双语富文本试写页，服务端输出真实公式与文档结构。 / Bilingual server-rendered rich-text specimen. */
interface Props {
  /** 展示语言。 / Specimen language. */
  locale?: "zh-CN" | "en";
}
const { locale = "zh-CN" } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === "en";
const content = en
  ? String.raw`### Coverage of a pinned release

A formula such as $e^{i\pi}+1=0$ stays inside its sentence, and **emphasis** stays restrained.

> A pinned URL is a contract: its bytes never change.

- [x] Keep the 0.1 variables working
- [x] Typeset Markdown math with one KaTeX version
- [ ] Publish the package to a registry

| Source | Good for |
| :-- | :-- |
| Markdown | Notes, links, and checklists |
| TeX | Derivations |

$$
\sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
$$

Continue with the [integration guide](/en/guides/).

~~~ts
const release = { version: "0.2.0", pinned: true };
~~~
`
  : String.raw`### 固定版本的覆盖范围

行内公式 $e^{i\pi}+1=0$ 留在句子里，**强调**保持克制。

> 固定地址就是契约：它的字节不会再变。

- [x] 0.1 的变量继续可用
- [x] Markdown 公式统一使用一个 KaTeX 版本
- [ ] 把包发布到 registry

| 来源 | 适合 |
| :-- | :-- |
| Markdown | 笔记、链接与清单 |
| TeX | 推导过程 |

$$
\sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
$$

接下来阅读[接入指南](/guides/)。

~~~ts
const release = { version: "0.2.0", pinned: true };
~~~
`;
const longFormula = String.raw`\underbrace{1 + 2 + 3 + \cdots + n}_{\text{ascending}} + \underbrace{n + (n-1) + (n-2) + \cdots + 1}_{\text{descending}} = \underbrace{(n+1) + (n+1) + \cdots + (n+1)}_{n\text{ pairs}} = n(n+1)`;
---

<section class="specimen" id="rich-text" data-testid="specimen-rich-text" aria-labelledby="rich-text-title">
  <div class="specimen__head">
    <h2 id="rich-text-title">Markdown &amp; TeX</h2>
  </div>
  <article class="stage" aria-label={en ? "Rendered Markdown and TeX" : "Markdown 与 TeX 排版示例"}>
    <Markdown content={content} />
  </article>
  <div class="stage">
    <Formula tex={longFormula} display />
  </div>
</section>
